{"id": 111657735, "slug": "now-they-want-us-to-bomb-data-centers", "title": "Now They Want Us To Bomb Data Centers", "subtitle": "& \"What about China?\"", "post_date": "2023-03-30T18:57:59.407Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 878, "reaction_count": 6, "comment_count": 0, "restacks": 0, "reactions": {"\u2764": 6}, "body_html": "<p>The only thing more popular on Twitter this week than the imminent demise of the dollar\u2019s status as global currency reserve is AI doomerism.</p><p>For those not up to speed, this week many prominent technologist came out with what amounts to the 21st century version of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anglo-German_Naval_Agreement\">British German pre-WWII naval treaty to limit warship tonnage</a>. </p><p>Well, we know how that went.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TJO7!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb136137a-26dc-4bf8-be0d-dca72e48928b_976x549.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TJO7!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb136137a-26dc-4bf8-be0d-dca72e48928b_976x549.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TJO7!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb136137a-26dc-4bf8-be0d-dca72e48928b_976x549.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TJO7!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb136137a-26dc-4bf8-be0d-dca72e48928b_976x549.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TJO7!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb136137a-26dc-4bf8-be0d-dca72e48928b_976x549.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TJO7!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb136137a-26dc-4bf8-be0d-dca72e48928b_976x549.png\" width=\"976\" height=\"549\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b136137a-26dc-4bf8-be0d-dca72e48928b_976x549.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:549,&quot;width&quot;:976,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Bismarck firing at HMS Hood&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"Bismarck firing at HMS Hood\" title=\"Bismarck firing at HMS Hood\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TJO7!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb136137a-26dc-4bf8-be0d-dca72e48928b_976x549.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TJO7!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb136137a-26dc-4bf8-be0d-dca72e48928b_976x549.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TJO7!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb136137a-26dc-4bf8-be0d-dca72e48928b_976x549.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TJO7!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb136137a-26dc-4bf8-be0d-dca72e48928b_976x549.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>The hysteria has reached a fever pitch, with eminent technologists calling for some version of a global authoritarian regulatory regime to limit the speed of AI development.</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://twitter.com/nytimes/status/1641274067633291264?s=20&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;More than 1,000 technology leaders and researchers, including Elon Musk, signed an open letter urging a pause in the development of the most powerful artificial intelligence systems, warning that AI tools present \u201cprofound risks to society and humanity.\u201d &quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;nytimes&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;The New York Times&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;Thu Mar 30 03:00:05 +0000 2023&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:509,&quot;like_count&quot;:1291,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://nyti.ms/3K3bvD4&quot;,&quot;image&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/0eadc307-bd2c-46e1-b94e-d516007da422_1050x550.jpeg&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Elon Musk and Others Call for Pause on A.I., Citing \u2018Profound Risks to Society\u2019&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;More than 1,000 tech leaders, researchers and others signed an open letter urging a moratorium on the development of the most powerful artificial intelligence systems.&quot;,&quot;domain&quot;:&quot;nyti.ms&quot;},&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>Some of these arguments are well founded (\u201clook at how difficult it is to control these machines, we should probably slow down before we build things we cannot control\u201d), some rather less so, essentially amounting to neo-Luddism (what about the all the jobs that will be automated away?!?!), or just a lack of understanding of the difficulties of, you know, overthrowing every human institution in the world.</p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.campbellramble.ai/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Thanks for reading Campbell Ramble! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email\u2026\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div><p>In classic fashion, the same Twitterati which are knowingly prognosticating on the demise of the dollar, are also making bold and confident proclamations about the macro economy (do they even know that spending equals income?!)  </p><p>As for the automation arguments, well, there aren\u2019t many farmers anymore.  Where did they go?</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jt-k!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd73c3b40-b21f-46b9-abc2-9e37f5f7746c_1421x1365.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jt-k!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd73c3b40-b21f-46b9-abc2-9e37f5f7746c_1421x1365.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jt-k!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd73c3b40-b21f-46b9-abc2-9e37f5f7746c_1421x1365.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jt-k!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd73c3b40-b21f-46b9-abc2-9e37f5f7746c_1421x1365.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jt-k!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd73c3b40-b21f-46b9-abc2-9e37f5f7746c_1421x1365.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jt-k!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd73c3b40-b21f-46b9-abc2-9e37f5f7746c_1421x1365.png\" width=\"395\" height=\"379.4334975369458\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d73c3b40-b21f-46b9-abc2-9e37f5f7746c_1421x1365.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1365,&quot;width&quot;:1421,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:395,&quot;bytes&quot;:159144,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jt-k!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd73c3b40-b21f-46b9-abc2-9e37f5f7746c_1421x1365.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jt-k!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd73c3b40-b21f-46b9-abc2-9e37f5f7746c_1421x1365.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jt-k!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd73c3b40-b21f-46b9-abc2-9e37f5f7746c_1421x1365.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Jt-k!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd73c3b40-b21f-46b9-abc2-9e37f5f7746c_1421x1365.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>This week, things escalated further when prominent AI doomer Yudkowsky came out with a plan to UNILATERALLY BOMB DATA CENTERS ABOVE A CERTAIN SIZE.</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://twitter.com/mattparlmer/status/1641230149663203330&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;In the past I have given credit where it was due to Eliezer Yudkowsky for not explicitly advocating violent solutions to the problems with AI development that by his own admission only he and a few other (mostly nontechnical) people see on the horizon\\n\\nHe crossed that line today &quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;mattparlmer&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;mattparlmer \ud83e\ude90 \ud83c\udf37&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;Thu Mar 30 00:05:34 +0000 2023&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[{&quot;img_url&quot;:&quot;https://pbs.substack.com/media/FsbSHxuX0AECUOb.jpg&quot;,&quot;link_url&quot;:&quot;https://t.co/zk1ylhFfNG&quot;,&quot;alt_text&quot;:null}],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:171,&quot;like_count&quot;:1281,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:{},&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>Well folks, it looks like we have crossed the Rubicon of imagination.  </p><p>Where not only is it inevitable that AI will achieve AGI, it will achieve superintelligence, &amp; necessarily develop into some shadow of the devil.  </p><p>AI will seize the memes of production, take over our institutions, and decide to destroy life on the planet in order to \u2026make more paperclips.</p><p>And, critically, \u201cWE HAVE NO MORE TIME\u201d to debate this.</p><p>What\u2019s ironic is not that this line of thinking jumps so many steps, but that this kind of thinking, unchecked from the mooring of reality or pragmatism, logically necessitates a global authoritarian regulatory regime with the mandate and power to use violence to attempt to slow or stop the development of AI.</p><p>And in this intellectual vacuum of logic, a simple question remains.  </p><p>Unanswered, though not for lack of me trying to ask it:</p><h2>What about China.</h2><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://twitter.com/abcampbell/status/1641241722675171328?s=20&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Again, if we\u2019re now proposing to air strike data centers\u2026\\n\\nWhat about China???\\n\\nIt\u2019s like these AI safety folks do phd level math to box themselves into a corner a 3rd grader could logic their way out of. &quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;abcampbell&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alexander Campbell&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;Thu Mar 30 00:51:34 +0000 2023&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;In the past I have given credit where it was due to Eliezer Yudkowsky for not explicitly advocating violent solutions to the problems with AI development that by his own admission only he and a few other (mostly nontechnical) people see on the horizon\\n\\nHe crossed that line today https://t.co/zk1ylhFfNG&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;mattparlmer&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;mattparlmer \ud83e\ude90 \ud83c\udf37&quot;},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:0,&quot;like_count&quot;:7,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:{},&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>See, as a (reformed) professional game theorist, I know a thing or two about taking things to their ridiculously logical conclusions.</p><p>You may have heard of the prisoner\u2019s dilemma, the idea that cooperation often leads to better outcomes, but without a way to coordinate or enforce cooperation, the natural state (and most likely) is for individuals to pursue their own self-interest, which in some cases lead to overall worse outcomes for everyone.  </p><p>Some, real world examples:</p><p>Aforementioned Naval Treaties</p><p>The race to mobilize for WWI</p><p>Nuclear non-proliferation</p><p>Gain of function research</p><p>Militarization of space</p><p>Climate change</p><p>This last one being a pretty good example, not only for the overall dynamics, but as a clue to the important players on the field, and what we already know about how they play these games.</p><p>A chart here helps.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9EKE!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9de805f8-526f-477a-89df-705d657874e0_1619x860.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9EKE!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9de805f8-526f-477a-89df-705d657874e0_1619x860.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9EKE!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9de805f8-526f-477a-89df-705d657874e0_1619x860.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9EKE!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9de805f8-526f-477a-89df-705d657874e0_1619x860.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9EKE!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9de805f8-526f-477a-89df-705d657874e0_1619x860.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9EKE!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9de805f8-526f-477a-89df-705d657874e0_1619x860.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"773\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9de805f8-526f-477a-89df-705d657874e0_1619x860.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:773,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:93118,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9EKE!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9de805f8-526f-477a-89df-705d657874e0_1619x860.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9EKE!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9de805f8-526f-477a-89df-705d657874e0_1619x860.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9EKE!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9de805f8-526f-477a-89df-705d657874e0_1619x860.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9EKE!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9de805f8-526f-477a-89df-705d657874e0_1619x860.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>So here we are, the West once again paralyzed by anxiety over existential risks that, alone, it pretty much has zero ability to control, contain or regulate.</p><p>The recent shift of AI safetiests / doomers being functionally equivalent to the climate doomers who maintain a world view where it somehow makes sense to shut down nuclear plants while China burns mountains of coal.</p><p>How much impact does a closed down nuclear plant have when China burns another 10 tons of coal?</p><p>Nothing.  </p><p>In fact, likely worse than nothing, as the replacement costs of that energy likely involve some combination of dirty fossil fuels, and commodity intensive energy infrastructure like solar and batteries.</p><p>So it goes.</p><p>Where does Mr. Yud come in?</p><p>Well, from a game theory perspective, given that both public and private sector in China seem to have unlimited appetite for using (and abusing) AI, we pretty clearly look to be in a prisoner\u2019s dilemma here.</p><p>One where the only logical conclusion from the AI Risk crowd is to\u2026</p><p>Start a nuclear war with China in order to control their investment in AI.</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://twitter.com/gammascalpset/status/1641485840399433729?s=20&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;<span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@abcampbell</span> <span class=\\&quot;tweet-fake-link\\&quot;>@tszzl</span> disclaimer: i haven't decided if I agree with him yet\\n\\ni think the crux of the argument here is your estimate of AI doom if we don't slow down. but AI doom is probably a worse outcome than nuclear war. \\n\\nhis argument is not insane, unless you think his estimate of AI doom is too&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;gammascalpset&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;gamma scalpset (blocked by 12/n postrats)&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;Thu Mar 30 17:01:36 +0000 2023&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:0,&quot;like_count&quot;:1,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:{},&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>Well.  </p><p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reductio_ad_absurdum\">Reductio ad absurdum</a> in the flesh.</p><p>Keep in mind, by the moral framework of the vast majority of humans, it\u2019s not even clear that we aught not prioritize the welfare of intelligent machines.</p><div class=\"embedded-post-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;id&quot;:80257089,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://campbellramble.substack.com/p/why-eating-meat-and-worrying-about&quot;,&quot;publication_id&quot;:312411,&quot;embedding_publication_id&quot;:null,&quot;publication_name&quot;:&quot;Campbell Ramble&quot;,&quot;publication_logo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcfe3791b-6bb6-4230-8940-054d6dd3133f_332x332.png&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Why eating meat and worrying about AGI is morally inconsistent.&quot;,&quot;truncated_body_text&quot;:&quot;Take a minute to ask yourself, \u201cwhy is it moral for me to eat another animal?\u201d Most arguments for eating meat (or wearing fur etc.) boil down to 'we are smarter than them, thus humans aught derive radically more moral weight in society than animals.&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2022-10-24T00:52:45.948Z&quot;,&quot;like_count&quot;:0,&quot;comment_count&quot;:0,&quot;bylines&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:23243013,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alexander Campbell&quot;,&quot;previous_name&quot;:null,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9b105c7a-be33-446c-8823-b297b83d0062_512x512.jpeg&quot;,&quot;bio&quot;:&quot;Founder rose.ai, fmr global macro investor at Bridgewater and Lehman&quot;,&quot;profile_set_up_at&quot;:&quot;2021-11-10T02:40:15.283Z&quot;,&quot;publicationUsers&quot;:[],&quot;is_guest&quot;:false,&quot;bestseller_tier&quot;:null}],&quot;utm_campaign&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;newsletter&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;,&quot;source&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"EmbeddedPostToDOM\"><a class=\"embedded-post\" native=\"true\" href=\"https://campbellramble.substack.com/p/why-eating-meat-and-worrying-about?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web\"><div class=\"embedded-post-header\"><img class=\"embedded-post-publication-logo\" src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KTpD!,w_56,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcfe3791b-6bb6-4230-8940-054d6dd3133f_332x332.png\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"embedded-post-publication-name\">Campbell Ramble</span></div><div class=\"embedded-post-title-wrapper\"><div class=\"embedded-post-title\">Why eating meat and worrying about AGI is morally inconsistent.</div></div><div class=\"embedded-post-body\">Take a minute to ask yourself, \u201cwhy is it moral for me to eat another animal?\u201d Most arguments for eating meat (or wearing fur etc.) boil down to 'we are smarter than them, thus humans aught derive radically more moral weight in society than animals\u2026</div><div class=\"embedded-post-cta-wrapper\"><span class=\"embedded-post-cta\">Read more</span></div><div class=\"embedded-post-meta\">4 years ago \u00b7 Alexander Campbell</div></a></div><p>Doesn\u2019t mean it doesn\u2019t make for good twitter content.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wAQw!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ab215c4-1b5a-43fb-a53b-007b184fd4ec_965x513.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wAQw!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ab215c4-1b5a-43fb-a53b-007b184fd4ec_965x513.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wAQw!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ab215c4-1b5a-43fb-a53b-007b184fd4ec_965x513.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wAQw!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ab215c4-1b5a-43fb-a53b-007b184fd4ec_965x513.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wAQw!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ab215c4-1b5a-43fb-a53b-007b184fd4ec_965x513.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wAQw!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ab215c4-1b5a-43fb-a53b-007b184fd4ec_965x513.png\" width=\"965\" height=\"513\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/1ab215c4-1b5a-43fb-a53b-007b184fd4ec_965x513.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:513,&quot;width&quot;:965,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:100236,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wAQw!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ab215c4-1b5a-43fb-a53b-007b184fd4ec_965x513.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wAQw!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ab215c4-1b5a-43fb-a53b-007b184fd4ec_965x513.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wAQw!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ab215c4-1b5a-43fb-a53b-007b184fd4ec_965x513.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!wAQw!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F1ab215c4-1b5a-43fb-a53b-007b184fd4ec_965x513.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\" tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Until next time.</p><p><em>Disclaimers</em></p><h6><em>Charts and graphs included in these materials are intended for educational purposes only and should not function as the sole basis for any investment decision.</em></h6><h6><em>THERE CAN BE NO ASSURANCE THAT ROSE TECHNOLOGY INVESTMENT OBJECTIVES WILL BE ACHIEVED OR THE INVESTMENT STRATEGIES WILL BE SUCCESSFUL.&nbsp;PAST RESULTS ARE NOT NECESSARILY INDICATIVE OF FUTURE RESULTS.&nbsp;AN INVESTMENT IN A FUND MANAGED BY ROSE INVOLVES A HIGH DEGREE OF RISK, INCLUDING THE RISK THAT THE ENTIRE AMOUNT INVESTED IS LOST.&nbsp;INTERESTED PROSPECTS MUST REFER TO A FUND\u2019S CONFIDENTIAL OFFERING MEMORANDUM FOR A DISCUSSION OF \u2018CERTAIN RISK FACTORS\u2019 AND OTHER IMPORTANT INFORMATION</em></h6><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.campbellramble.ai/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Thanks for reading Campbell Ramble! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email\u2026\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div>", "canonical_url": "https://www.campbellramble.ai/p/now-they-want-us-to-bomb-data-centers", "postTags": []}